Before the user can access the earning features, their dashboard needs to be validated.

### Validation Fee

**$5 = ₦5,000**

The interface could show:

> ### Validate Your Dashboard
>
> Complete your one-time dashboard validation to unlock Optify earning features.

```text
Validation Fee

$5.00
₦5,000

[ Validate Dashboard ]
```

Payment is processed through **Paystack**.

After successful payment:

```text
