## 16. One thing I'd change in the wording

Rather than making Optify communicate that users will definitely "earn money," I'd make the interface describe **rewards** and clearly show the conditions for receiving them.

For example:

> **Complete eligible tasks to receive Optify rewards.**

And every reward should have its rules visible.

That makes the platform's mechanics much clearer to users and avoids presenting projected rewards as guaranteed income.

